{"id":"40d1acedbbf319e7","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-dpll.md","title":"DPLL Algorithm","display":"df-dpll — DPLL Algorithm","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-dpll","aliases":["57-df-dpll"],"display":"df-dpll — DPLL Algorithm","depends_on":["[[57-df-literal]]","[[57-df-clause]]","[[57-df-finite]]","[[57-df-partial-function]]","[[57-df-prop-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-pow-fin]]","[[57-df-max-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-dpll"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-dpll</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dpll — DPLL Algorithm"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" href=\"?note=1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" title=\"57-df-literal\">57-df-literal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"963b86b5dc15d7e3\" href=\"?note=963b86b5dc15d7e3\" title=\"57-df-clause\">57-df-clause</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b060448f50c005a8\" href=\"?note=b060448f50c005a8\" title=\"57-df-finite\">57-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cda5e2779ea7246f\" href=\"?note=cda5e2779ea7246f\" title=\"57-df-partial-function\">57-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ab724e3f7d0fed3\" href=\"?note=4ab724e3f7d0fed3\" title=\"57-df-prop-satisfaction\">57-df-prop-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3eb5cdea39272c18\" href=\"?note=3eb5cdea39272c18\" title=\"57-df-pow-fin\">57-df-pow-fin</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6e90892ab288d53f\" href=\"?note=6e90892ab288d53f\" title=\"57-df-max-function\">57-df-max-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"DPLL-Algorithm\">DPLL Algorithm</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\subseteq\\mathrm{Clause}_S\">\\(N\\subseteq\\mathrm{Clause}_S\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(N)\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}(N)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"963b86b5dc15d7e3\" href=\"?note=963b86b5dc15d7e3\" title=\"57-df-clause\">57-df-clause</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b060448f50c005a8\" href=\"?note=b060448f50c005a8\" title=\"57-df-finite\">57-df-finite</a>。文字、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{atom}\">\\(\\mathrm{atom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pol}\">\\(\\mathrm{pol}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline L\">\\(\\overline L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" href=\"?note=1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" title=\"57-df-literal\">57-df-literal</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 是定义域包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Atoms}(N)\">\\(\\mathrm{Atoms}(N)\\)</span> 的部分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropVar}_S\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PropVar}_S\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"cda5e2779ea7246f\" href=\"?note=cda5e2779ea7246f\" title=\"57-df-partial-function\">57-df-partial-function</a>；初始赋值是空图，不是全赋值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定语法表示上可计算的单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:\\mathrm{PropVar}_S\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(c:\\mathrm{PropVar}_S\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 是下述文字编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min_\\ell\">\\(\\min_\\ell\\)</span> 只用于非空有限文字集，由下式唯一确定；此顺序是算法环境参数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{True}_v,\\mathrm{False}_v,\\mathrm{red},\\mathrm{Units},\\mathrm{Pure},v\\langle L\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{True}_v,\\mathrm{False}_v,\\mathrm{red},\\mathrm{Units},\\mathrm{Pure},v\\langle L\\rangle\\)</span> 是本文件定义的辅助对象。递归式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\mathrm{red}(N,v)\">\\(R=\\mathrm{red}(N,v)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\mathrm{Units}(R)\">\\(U=\\mathrm{Units}(R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=\\mathrm{Pure}(R)\">\\(E=\\mathrm{Pure}(R)\\)</span>；最后分支的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\min_\\ell(\\bigcup R)\">\\(L=\\min_\\ell(\\bigcup R)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DPLL\\text{-}search}\">\\(\\mathrm{DPLL\\text{-}search}\\)</span> 值域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；递归按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathrm{Atoms}(N)\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(v)|\">\\(|\\mathrm{Atoms}(N)\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(v)|\\)</span> 严格下降。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"3eb5cdea39272c18\" href=\"?note=3eb5cdea39272c18\" title=\"57-df-pow-fin\">57-df-pow-fin</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lit}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" href=\"?note=1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" title=\"57-df-literal\">57-df-literal</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 上的二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\max\">\\(\\max\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"6e90892ab288d53f\" href=\"?note=6e90892ab288d53f\" title=\"57-df-max-function\">57-df-max-function</a>；两个递归返回值均为自然数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall L\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_S\\quad\\ell(L)\\coloneqq2c(\\mathrm{atom}(L))+\\mathrm{pol}(L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall L\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_S\\quad\\ell(L)\\coloneqq2c(\\mathrm{atom}(L))+\\mathrm{pol}(L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Atoms}(N)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{atom}(L):L\\in\\bigcup N\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{True}_v&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_S:\\mathrm{atom}(L)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(v)\\land v(\\mathrm{atom}(L))=\\mathrm{pol}(L)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{False}_v&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_S:\\mathrm{atom}(L)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(v)\\land v(\\mathrm{atom}(L))\\neq\\mathrm{pol}(L)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{red}(N,v)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{C\\setminus\\mathrm{False}_v:C\\in N\\land C\\cap\\mathrm{True}_v=\\emptyset\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Units}(R)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_S:\\{L\\}\\in R\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Pure}(R)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L\\in\\bigcup R:\\overline L\\notin\\bigcup R\\},\\\\\nv\\langle L\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq v\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathrm{atom}(L),\\mathrm{pol}(L)\\rangle\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Atoms}(N)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{atom}(L):L\\in\\bigcup N\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{True}_v&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_S:\\mathrm{atom}(L)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(v)\\land v(\\mathrm{atom}(L))=\\mathrm{pol}(L)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{False}_v&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_S:\\mathrm{atom}(L)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(v)\\land v(\\mathrm{atom}(L))\\neq\\mathrm{pol}(L)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{red}(N,v)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{C\\setminus\\mathrm{False}_v:C\\in N\\land C\\cap\\mathrm{True}_v=\\emptyset\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Units}(R)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_S:\\{L\\}\\in R\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Pure}(R)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{L\\in\\bigcup R:\\overline L\\notin\\bigcup R\\},\\\\\nv\\langle L\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq v\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathrm{atom}(L),\\mathrm{pol}(L)\\rangle\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall E\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Lit}_S)\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\quad\n\\min_\\ell(E)=L\\leftrightarrow L\\in E\\land\\forall M\\in E\\;(\\ell(L)\\leq\\ell(M)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall E\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Lit}_S)\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\quad\n\\min_\\ell(E)=L\\leftrightarrow L\\in E\\land\\forall M\\in E\\;(\\ell(L)\\leq\\ell(M)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DPLL\\text{-}search}(N,v)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;R=\\emptyset,\\\\\n0,&amp;\\emptyset\\in R,\\\\\n\\mathrm{DPLL\\text{-}search}(N,v\\langle\\min_\\ell(U)\\rangle),&amp;R\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\emptyset\\notin R\\land U\\neq\\emptyset,\\\\\n\\mathrm{DPLL\\text{-}search}(N,v\\langle\\min_\\ell(E)\\rangle),&amp;R\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\emptyset\\notin R\\land U=\\emptyset\\land E\\neq\\emptyset,\\\\\n\\max\\{\\mathrm{DPLL\\text{-}search}(N,v\\langle L\\rangle),\\mathrm{DPLL\\text{-}search}(N,v\\langle\\overline L\\rangle)\\},&amp;R\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\emptyset\\notin R\\land U=E=\\emptyset.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DPLL\\text{-}search}(N,v)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;R=\\emptyset,\\\\\n0,&amp;\\emptyset\\in R,\\\\\n\\mathrm{DPLL\\text{-}search}(N,v\\langle\\min_\\ell(U)\\rangle),&amp;R\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\emptyset\\notin R\\land U\\neq\\emptyset,\\\\\n\\mathrm{DPLL\\text{-}search}(N,v\\langle\\min_\\ell(E)\\rangle),&amp;R\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\emptyset\\notin R\\land U=\\emptyset\\land E\\neq\\emptyset,\\\\\n\\max\\{\\mathrm{DPLL\\text{-}search}(N,v\\langle L\\rangle),\\mathrm{DPLL\\text{-}search}(N,v\\langle\\overline L\\rangle)\\},&amp;R\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\emptyset\\notin R\\land U=E=\\emptyset.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DPLL}(N)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{DPLL\\text{-}search}(N,\\emptyset).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DPLL}(N)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{DPLL\\text{-}search}(N,\\emptyset).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>剩余子句中的每个文字都未被赋值，故每次递归确实增加一个已赋值原子且保持单值；有限下降保证函数存在唯一。成功条件是所有子句已满足，不是某个文字为假也返回成功。采用 LAMR 的部分赋值、剩余子句、单位传播与纯文字原则；具体固定选择顺序不改变布尔答案。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"DPLL-Algorithm","text":"DPLL Algorithm","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"1f6f3fb73df6e11c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-literal]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"963b86b5dc15d7e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"b060448f50c005a8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"cda5e2779ea7246f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-prop-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"4ab724e3f7d0fed3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-prop-sati